## 🔐 Authentication Flow

- `POST /api/auth/login` → accepts `{ enrollmentNo, password }` → returns JWT access token (15min) + sets httpOnly refresh token cookie
- `POST /api/auth/refresh` → reads refresh token from cookie → returns new access token
- `POST /api/auth/logout` → clears refresh token cookie
- All dashboard routes are protected by `authMiddleware.js` which validates the Bearer token
- Axios interceptor on the client auto-refreshes the token on 401 response

